    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the Algorithm. It Loves You.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Waifu Pilled</i> is a satirical match-3 dating sim fused with a visual novel \u2014 set in a glitchy vaporwave nightmare where love is transactional and self-worth is gamified.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the corporate waifu ladder by crushing tiles, navigating reputation systems, and forming alliances with synthetic goddesses of influence. Every choice you make echoes through your social rank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced match-3 puzzles with combo-based powerups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching narrative paths and waifu relationship systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reputation mechanics with real consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surreal vaporwave aesthetic full of CRT glitches and pastel psychosis</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice lines, secrets, upgrades, and unlockable outfits</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were never supposed to wake up. But now that you have... it\u2019s time to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <i>Waifu Pilled: Love the Algorithm, or die trying.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the Algorithm. It Loves You.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Waifu Pilled</i> is a satirical match-3 dating sim fused with a visual novel \u2014 set in a glitchy vaporwave nightmare where love is transactional and self-worth is gamified.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the corporate waifu ladder by crushing tiles, navigating reputation systems, and forming alliances with synthetic goddesses of influence. Every choice you make echoes through your social rank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced match-3 puzzles with combo-based powerups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching narrative paths and waifu relationship systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reputation mechanics with real consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surreal vaporwave aesthetic full of CRT glitches and pastel psychosis</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice lines, secrets, upgrades, and unlockable outfits</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were never supposed to wake up. But now that you have... it\u2019s time to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <i>Waifu Pilled: Love the Algorithm, or die trying.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "A satirical match-3 dating sim set in a neon-drenched corporate dystopia. Crush tiles, charm synthetic waifus, and glitch your way to power in this vaporwave nightmare of love and late-stage capitalism. If you found this game, it wasn't an accident... I have something I want you to hear.",
